Categories:
  - Internet
  - Social Network
  - Voice & Video Chat
License: Apache-2.0
AuthorName: Noah Frank
AuthorWebSite: https://github.com/noah-be
SourceCode: https://github.com/noah-be/overte
IssueTracker: https://github.com/noah-be/overte/issues

AutoName: Overte Mobile (Unofficial)

RepoType: git
Repo: https://github.com/noah-be/overte.git

Builds:
  - versionName: 0.1.0
    versionCode: 1
    disable: Draft pending public source commit and standard-toolchain build validation
    commit: @COMMIT@
    timeout: 43200
    subdir: android/phone
    sudo:
      - cd /tmp
      - apt-get update
      - apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates gcc g++ cmake
        ninja-build openjdk-21-jdk-headless git make patch perl python3-pip
        python3-venv tar xz-utils util-linux iproute2
    output: apps/phoneInterface/build/outputs/apk/release/*.apk
    prebuild:
      - python3 -m venv "$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan"
      - '"$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan/bin/pip" install --no-cache-dir conan==2.25.2'
      - sdkmanager --sdk_root $$SDK$$ 'platforms;android-36' 'build-tools;35.0.0'
        'build-tools;36.0.0' 'cmake;3.31.6' 'cmdline-tools;22.0'
    scandelete:
      - android/common/tests/javascript/package.json
      - scripts/communityScripts/libraries/materialdesignicons/package.json
      - scripts/developer/tests/unit_tests/package.json
      - tests-manual/entities/packet.bin
      - tests/mocha/package.json
      - tools/nitpick/AppDataHighFidelity/assignment-client/entities/models.json.gz
      - tools/nitpick/AppDataHighFidelity/domain-server/entities/models.json.gz
      - unpublishedScripts/marketplace/doppleganger-attachments/package.json
    build:
      - export PATH="$HOME/.overte-fdroid/conan/bin:$PATH"
      - python3 fdroid/submission/build.py --commit $$COMMIT$$ --version-code $$VERCODE$$
        --version-name $$VERSION$$ --sdk $$SDK$$ --work-dir "$PWD/../../../.overte-phone-fdroid-build"
    ndk: 27.3.13750724

MaintainerNotes: |
  Unofficial Android Phone fork maintained by Noah Frank; not an official Overte release.
  All native dependencies are built from the locked public source closure.
  Acquisition precedes network-isolated compilation; no Conan binaries are used.
  Gradle 8.13 is obtained from its official distribution with its pinned SHA-256.
  F-Droid removes the checked-in wrapper; the build does not require that wrapper.
  scandelete is restricted to unused test data and npm package manifests. The
  referenced JavaScript, icons, licenses and runtime assets remain untouched.
  Requires SDK 36, Build-Tools 35.0.0 and 36.0.0 and SDK CMake 3.31.6, plus the listed NDK.
  Command-line Tools 22.0 supply apkanalyzer for the release APK checks.
  Uses the standard Debian trixie GCC/G++, CMake, Ninja and OpenJDK 21 packages.
  No snapshot, unstable repository, exact Debian package pin or compiler
  alternatives override is required. The new toolchain needs a full clean build;
  the earlier successful GCC 15/OpenJDK 17 build does not qualify this recipe.
  Store text and graphics are imported from android/phone/fastlane in the source.
  subdir selects that directory; script, output and work-directory paths have
  been adjusted equivalently since the VM test, without changing build inputs.
  Standard F-Droid signing is requested; bit-for-bit reproducibility against
  a separately published upstream APK has not been qualified.
  Automatic updates use android-phone-v<versionName>+<versionCode> tags only.
  For example android-phone-v0.1.0+1 selects versionName 0.1.0 and versionCode 1.
  Increase versionCode for each new Android release; iOS/Pico tags are ignored.
  The existing android-phone-v0.1.0+1 tag still points to the earlier toolchain.
  Do not move it; coordinate a new release tag after validation.
  System package provisioning is inlined here; no app repository script runs as root.
  Conan 2.25.2 is installed in the build user home without sudo.
  These standard-toolchain changes have not yet completed a full CI build.
  Do not use the local Android debug signing certificate as an upstream release key.

AutoUpdateMode: Version
UpdateCheckMode: Tags ^android-phone-v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\+[1-9][0-9]*$
UpdateCheckData: '|\+([0-9]+)$||^android-phone-v([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)\+'
CurrentVersion: 0.1.0
CurrentVersionCode: 1
